{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13311120","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13311120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1331112001:1":{"text":"이번에 만들고 싶은 건 눈사람 기계예요! 자동으로 눈사람을 만들어주는 기계죠...","source_cn":"我这次想要制造的是雪人机！那种可以自动堆雪人的机器……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9CD1A4730358F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1331112002:1":{"text":"시더 마을 사람들이 눈사람 만들 줄을 모른다고 생각하는 건가?","source_cn":"你是觉得雪松镇的人都不会堆雪人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04077B9A82CBA8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331112003:1":{"text":"다들 눈사람은 잘 만들겠죠. 하지만 평범한 눈사람을 만드는 거잖아요. 너무 식상하단 말이에요! 그래서 이 기계로 다양한 모습의 눈사람을 만들면 어떨까 해서요... 어때요?","source_cn":"我知道大家都会堆雪人，但是他们只会堆普通的雪人，那也太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30590AA84B083BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1331112004:1":{"text":"정말... 눈앞이 깜깜해지는 아이디어군.","source_cn":"真是……令人眼前一黑的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9820386D7F10C354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人特莱姆":{"text":"상인 틀렘","source":"商人特莱姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人工匠司都恩":{"text":"드워프 장인 시둔","source":"矮人工匠司都恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}